{"slug":"q-r-b","ar":"ق ر ب","total":96,"core":"nearness; approach; kinship","forms":[{"ar":"قَرِيب","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":26,"gloss":"near, close","word":null,"ex":{"s":70,"a":7,"p":2,"ar":["وَنَرَىٰهُ","قَرِيبًا"],"en":"But We see it [as] near"}},{"ar":"أَقْرَب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":19,"gloss":"nearer, nearest; near relatives","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":214,"p":3,"ar":["وَأَنذِرْ","عَشِيرَتَكَ","ٱلْأَقْرَبِينَ"],"en":"And warn, [O Muhammad], your closest kindred"}},{"ar":"قُرْبَىٰ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":16,"gloss":"Kinship, near relatives","word":"qurba","ex":{"s":17,"a":26,"p":3,"ar":["وَءَاتِ","ذَا","ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ","حَقَّهُۥ","وَٱلْمِسْكِينَ","وَٱبْنَ","ٱلسَّبِيلِ","وَلَا","تُبَذِّرْ","تَبْذِيرًا"],"en":"And give the relative his right, and [also] the poor and the traveler, and do not spend wastefully"}},{"ar":"يَقْرَبُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":11,"gloss":"to approach, go near","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":32,"p":2,"ar":["وَلَا","تَقْرَبُوا۟","ٱلزِّنَىٰٓ ۖ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","فَـٰحِشَةً","وَسَآءَ","سَبِيلًا"],"en":"And do not approach unlawful sexual intercourse. Indeed, it is ever an immorality and is evil as a way"}},{"ar":"مُقَرَّبُون","kind":"passive participle","form":2,"count":8,"gloss":"those brought near","word":null,"ex":{"s":56,"a":11,"p":2,"ar":["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","ٱلْمُقَرَّبُونَ"],"en":"Those are the ones brought near [to Allah]"}},{"ar":"قَرَّبَ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":5,"gloss":"to bring near; to offer","word":null,"ex":{"s":51,"a":27,"p":1,"ar":["فَقَرَّبَهُۥٓ","إِلَيْهِمْ","قَالَ","أَلَا","تَأْكُلُونَ"],"en":"And placed it near them; he said, \"Will you not eat"}},{"ar":"ٱقْتَرَبَ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":5,"gloss":"to draw near, approach","word":null,"ex":{"s":54,"a":1,"p":1,"ar":["ٱقْتَرَبَتِ","ٱلسَّاعَةُ","وَٱنشَقَّ","ٱلْقَمَرُ"],"en":"The Hour has come near, and the moon has split [in two]"}},{"ar":"قُرْبَان","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"offering, sacrifice","word":null,"ex":{"s":46,"a":28,"p":8,"ar":["فَلَوْلَا","نَصَرَهُمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","قُرْبَانًا","ءَالِهَةًۢ ۖ","بَلْ","ضَلُّوا۟","عَنْهُمْ ۚ","وَذَٰلِكَ","إِفْكُهُمْ","وَمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَفْتَرُونَ"],"en":"Then why did those they took besides Allah as deities by which to approach [Him] not aid them? But they had strayed from them. And that was their falsehood and what they were inventing"}},{"ar":"مَقْرَبَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"kinship, near relation","word":null,"ex":{"s":90,"a":15,"p":3,"ar":["يَتِيمًا","ذَا","مَقْرَبَةٍ"],"en":"An orphan of near relationship"}},{"ar":"قُرْبَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"means of nearness","word":null,"ex":{"s":9,"a":99,"p":18,"ar":["وَمِنَ","ٱلْأَعْرَابِ","مَن","يُؤْمِنُ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","وَيَتَّخِذُ","مَا","يُنفِقُ","قُرُبَـٰتٍ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَصَلَوَٰتِ","ٱلرَّسُولِ ۚ","أَلَآ","إِنَّهَا","قُرْبَةٌ","لَّهُمْ ۚ","سَيُدْخِلُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","فِى","رَحْمَتِهِۦٓ ۗ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"en":"But among the bedouins are some who believe in Allah and the Last Day and consider what they spend as means of nearness to Allah and of [obtaining] invocations of the Messenger. Unquestionably, it is a means of nearness for them. Allah will admit them to His mercy. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful"}},{"ar":"قُرُبَٰت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"means of nearness","word":null,"ex":{"s":9,"a":99,"p":11,"ar":["وَمِنَ","ٱلْأَعْرَابِ","مَن","يُؤْمِنُ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","وَيَتَّخِذُ","مَا","يُنفِقُ","قُرُبَـٰتٍ","عِندَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَصَلَوَٰتِ","ٱلرَّسُولِ ۚ","أَلَآ","إِنَّهَا","قُرْبَةٌ","لَّهُمْ ۚ","سَيُدْخِلُهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","فِى","رَحْمَتِهِۦٓ ۗ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"en":"But among the bedouins are some who believe in Allah and the Last Day and consider what they spend as means of nearness to Allah and of [obtaining] invocations of the Messenger. Unquestionably, 